;; Root of raylib-clj-demo. Every demo is its own sub-project (<demo>/deps.edn)
;; and runs from its own directory with `bb run`, which is where its
;; resources/ resolve. On the JVM, run `clojure -M:jvm:<demo>` from here,
;; adding :mac on macOS, for a demo that loads no files from resources/.
;;
;; Generated by `bb gen` from demos.edn. Don't hand-edit the aliases: add the
;; demo to demos.edn and re-run it instead. The bindings arrive through
;; common/, which depends on the repository root.
